Corrected message:

Test that autosave held off by a drag is forced through at 300 s

Adds a test that holds the pointer down across simulated autosave
ticks and checks the save is deferred at 0 s and 299 s, then forced
through at 300 s.

To make that possible headlessly, AutosaveManager gains internal test
hooks (PointerButtonHeldOverride, Clock, ExporterOverride) and
TryAutosave becomes internal. No behavior change when the hooks are
unset.
